cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Siontology in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: Siontology
abstract: >-
  The reference implementation of a neo-blockchain, a network whose product
  is verified knowledge rather than ordered transactions. It runs as a
  devnet: owned transactions finalize with one committee certificate,
  contended ones through consensus, two independent proof stacks check
  every Pulse, and a light client verifies certificates, receipts, state
  and data availability from a pinned genesis.
authors:
  - name: ColdAI
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ColdAI-org/siontology"
url: "https://siontology.org"
keywords:
  - neo-blockchain
  - consensus
  - light client
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - data availability
  - mechanism design
